{
  "slug": "hobzup-website",
  "projectSlug": "hobzup",
  "title": "Website",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "0aulcp2x",
      "title": "The exercise",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "oe5hbctq",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "2j5vieo6",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "No client, on purpose"
              },
              {
                "id": "gbu08vvv",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "I set myself a challenge: design a full sportswear e-commerce landing page, from hero to footer, with no brief and no one to please but the work. The goal was not a portfolio piece. It was to push a louder, higher-energy visual direction than my product work usually calls for, and to see if I could hold it across a whole page."
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "flag"
    },
    {
      "id": "rx5cy5ns",
      "title": "The direction",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "zzi913gi",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "2dzu4tqh",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "Loud on purpose"
              },
              {
                "id": "kuviyvgm",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "Sportswear lives on energy, so I built the page around it: a red and black palette, hard diagonal motion, and large confident type. Red carries the action and nothing else, so a single accent word or button pulls the eye exactly where it should go on a page that is otherwise dark and still. The restraint is what keeps the energy from turning into noise."
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": "6wimw0mx",
      "title": "The build ",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "veq4fe1x",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "qknnkiuf",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "A full page, not a poster"
              },
              {
                "id": "4iutygk7",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "I designed the whole journey a real store needs, not just a pretty hero:"
              },
              {
                "id": "d0d9v46e",
                "kind": "list",
                "items": [
                  "A hero that states the attitude before the product",
                  "New arrivals as product cards, each with its own name and price",
                  "A feature band for apparel, with motion built into the layout",
                  "An interactive category row that reveals its copy on hover",
                  "A gallery of training shots",
                  "Email capture and a complete footer"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "ijz4zokv",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "Designing every section, including the boring ones, is where an exercise stops being a mood board and starts being a product."
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4uik49g8",
      "title": "The Design",
      "rows": [
        {
